FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: a-pilgrimage.

OFF THE RECORD: a journey of one thousand days. Kill the official at
OFF THE RECORD: any moment (Ctrl+C); every completed step is already
OFF THE RECORD: on file, so the case resumes from exactly where it
OFF THE RECORD: stood -- on this machine, or any machine that can
OFF THE RECORD: reach the broker, running any operating system:
OFF THE RECORD:     trial proceed <case>
