ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT day IS 1.

ARTICLE 2.
    PROCLAIM day.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT day IS day PLUS 1.
    SHOULD day FAIL TO EXCEED 1000, REFER TO ARTICLE 2.

ARTICLE 3.
    PROCLAIM "The gate was open the whole time.".
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
